# Original Fractint 20.04p17 official rule library:
# FRACTINT | Penrose1Color { ; by Herb Savage
# FRACTINT | ; based on Martin Gardner's "Penrose Tiles to Trapdoor Ciphers",
# FRACTINT | ; Roger Penrose's rhombuses
# FRACTINT | ; Uses color to show similar lines
# FRACTINT |   Angle 10
# FRACTINT |   Axiom +WC10F--XC12F---YC12F--ZC10F
# FRACTINT |   W=YC12F++ZC10F----XC12F[-YC12F----WC10F]++
# FRACTINT |   X=+YC12F--ZC10F[---WC10F--XC12F]+
# FRACTINT |   Y=-WC10F++XC12F[+++YC12F++ZC10F]-
# FRACTINT |   Z=--YC12F++++WC10F[+ZC10F++++XC12F]--XC12F
# FRACTINT |   F=
# FRACTINT |   }
